# cdplayer
===
 A desktop music player that feels like a real CD player — for your local music, audio CDs and Spotify. Spinning disc, CD shelf, lyrics & karaoke, lossless/hi-res playback, spatial audio for headphones, CD ripping to FLAC. macOS, Windows, Linux.
